rredact includes PII regex rules adapted from OpenRedact / nerwhal and OpenRedaction:

  https://github.com/openredact/nerwhal
  https://gitlab.opencode.de/bmbf/datenlabor/openredact

OpenRedact and nerwhal are distributed under the MIT License. Imported
OpenRedact regex rules are in defaults/openredact.yaml.

OpenRedaction is distributed under the MIT License. Imported OpenRedaction
patterns are in defaults/openredaction.yaml and cover a much broader PII set.
The statistical NER components of OpenRedact are not included.

OpenRedaction: https://github.com/sam247/openredaction (MIT License).

